      "writtenOn": "2021-09-30T13:34:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, that\u0027s unfortunate. `apexBundle` implements the deprecated `AndroidMkDataProvider` interface, and the information can only be retrieved by `AndroidMkDataForTest`, while `Prebuilt` implements the new `AndroidMkEntriesProvider` interface, and the information can only be retrieved by `AndroidMkEntriesForTest`. There is no function that can work for both interfaces.",
      "parentUuid": "9e3e3122_072ec6d8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8464,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 8464,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "0dac924c78ce95a81f78e77dae73e9980889c8be",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
