      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-01T13:48:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Optional, but it wouldn\u0027t be difficult to add a tool function in testing.go that encapsulates this, would it? I think it\u0027d be a good thing to have, considering the prevalence of the clunky code to do this in lots of places.",
      "parentUuid": "d05c9823_b6208755",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8464,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 8464,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "0dac924c78ce95a81f78e77dae73e9980889c8be",
